WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:04.320
Money, it’s a pillar of human civilization.

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:10.430
A hidden network that touches every part of
our lives, what we eat, where we work, how

00:00:10.430 --> 00:00:12.470
we express ourselves.

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:17.910
Your relationship with money may determine
whether you find happiness or lead a stressed

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:18.910
out life.

00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:21.849
But a little knowledge can make a huge difference.

00:00:21.849 --> 00:00:23.339
I’m Philip Olson.

00:00:23.339 --> 00:00:25.619
And, I’m Julia Lorenz-Olson.

00:00:25.619 --> 00:00:31.920
Join us as we unravel the mysteries of the
world of finance where psychology and economics

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:33.270
meet.

00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:38.250
Not only can it improve your life, you’ll
learn a lot about how your own brain works,

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:39.981
and why our world is the way it is.

00:00:39.981 --> 00:00:43.720
This is Two Cents.

